Package: MTRClust
Type: Package
Title: Robust Clustering of Multivariate Panel Trajectories
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Hasan", family = "Bulut",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "hasan.bulut@omu.edu.tr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6924-9651"))
  )
Description: Provides a robust alternating algorithm for clustering numeric
    multivariate panel trajectories stored as n by T by p arrays. The main
    function estimates smooth low-rank cluster trajectories, trims whole
    observations, records termination and rollback diagnostics, and returns
    multilevel outlier summaries for observation, temporal, sensor-segment, and
    cell-level structure.
